{{About|the biblical creature|other uses of the term|Leviathan (disambiguation)|the prehistoric whale|Livyatan{{!}}''Livyatan''|the book by Thomas Hobbes|Leviathan (Hobbes book){{!}}''Leviathan'' (Hobbes book)}}
